taff:170322","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"天倉 りぃ","creatorId":"vndb:s44929","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s44929","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s44929","name":"天倉 りぃ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:170323","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c94190","characterName":"桜坂 悠月","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"87461","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"320054"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23202"],"vndbCharacterId":"c94190"},"originalCharacterName":"桜坂 悠月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a cheerful and lively part-time student with a trademark \"cute smile\" who can quickly get along and treat everyone equally. She has always liked working and helping out, but she also has a lot of interests in fashion, gaming, and going out... She has a lot of hobbies, so she works several jobs to earn money to spend on them. She occasionally makes a narcissistic remark that's just her joking, so she's waiting for a joke back, yet if you reply seriously, she'll become shy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94190"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノリがよく、誰にでも分け隔てなく接することができる「可愛い笑顔」がトレードマークの明朗快活なバイト学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もともと働くことやお手伝いが好きということもあるのだが、オシャレにゲームにお出かけに……非常に多趣味なためそこに費やすためのお小遣い稼ぎで複数のバイトを掛け持ちしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時たまする若干ナルシストのような発言はふざけているだけで、いわゆるツッコミ待ちの状態なのでマジで返すとはにかむ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23202","sourceWorkId":"30259","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノリがよく、誰にでも分け隔てなく接することができる 「可愛い笑顔」がトレードマークの明朗快活なバイト学生。もともと働くことやお手伝いが好きということもあるのだが、オシャレにゲームにお出かけに……非常に多趣味なためそこに費やすためのお小遣い稼ぎで複数のバイトを掛け持ちしている。時たまする若干ナルシストのような発言はふざけているだけで、 いわゆるツッコミ待ちの状態なのでマジで返すとはにかむ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"87461"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7cadd42fffdf7a17464a46d304a1b485c72cb70a3e9832965bdfa256044fe467.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25b59a87cd270216bd63ac22d877c71d2d4843aa971c68d25607b190714f9304.webp","width":138,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さいとうよしえ","creatorId":"vndb:s1545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1545","name":"さいとう よしえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:320054:87461:20696:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c94191","characterName":"なっちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"87462","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"320054"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23203"],"vndbCharacterId":"c94191"},"originalCharacterName":"なっちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Natsuho is a popular schoolgirl who teaches the protagonist how to be more fashionable as a favor to her former senpai. Although she is a little self-centered, she is a good girl who cares about others while aiming to be a mature woman. An adult woman, in Natsuho's eyes, is one who initiates romantic interactions and is not shy about pursuing the attention of men. As such, she acts a bit mature compared to her age, but she can be devilish or shameless when she wants to!"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94191"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元後輩のよしみで主人公にオシャレを教えてくれる現役バリバリの女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し自己中心的ではあるものの、きちんと相手のことも思いやれるいい子でオトナな女性を目指している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女にとっての「オトナな女性」とは男を手のひらで転がす女性らしい。そのため、年に似合わずちょっとませているため良く言えば小悪魔的、悪く言えばかしましい女の子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23203","sourceWorkId":"30259","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元後輩のよしみで主人公にオシャレを教えてくれる現役バリバリの女子校生。少し自己中心的ではあるものの、きちんと相手のことも思いやれるいい子でオトナな女性を目指している。そんな彼女にとっての「オトナな女性」とは男を手のひらで転がす女性らしい。そのため、年に似合わずちょっとませているため良く言えば小悪魔的、悪く言えばかしましい女の子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"87462"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/971b764d93720f4ac335c45d97155fc150ffb68ab8ea405ac26f3f5b6950c58a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a73947062847a4d03a66092031bee4ae73faaf6d02378f6866016f2b379428fd.webp","width":138,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大地葉","creatorId":"vndb:s10070","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10070","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10070","name":"大地 葉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:320054:87462:10869:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c94192","characterName":"秋月 美琴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"87463","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"320054"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23204"],"vndbCharacterId":"c94192"},"originalCharacterName":"秋月 美琴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"229"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lives in the apartment building where the main character lives. She has the air of a super-skilled office worker and, in fact, works for a good company. However, as a reaction to this, she's a bit sloppy in her room, where she doesn't have other people's eyes, and sometimes drinks alcohol from morning onwards. When she has energy, she goes out in the city and enjoys her current life in moderation while doing her best as a career woman."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94192"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が住むマンションのお隣さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雰囲気的に超できるOL感があり、実際それなりの企業に努めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただその反動か他人の目線がない自室では基本はだらだらとしたり、時には朝からお酒を飲んでいたりと、ちょっとだらしない側面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気があるときは街に出たりして、適度に今の生活を楽しみながら頑張っているキャリアウーマン。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23204","sourceWorkId":"30259","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が住むマンションのおとなりさん。雰囲気的に超できるOL感があり、実際それなりの企業に努めている。ただその反動か他人の目線がない自室では基本はだらだらとしたり、時には朝からお酒を飲んでいたりと、ちょっとだらしない側面も。元気があるときは街に出たりして、適度に今の生活を楽しみながら頑張っているキャリアウーマン。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"87463"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0eab8a98ead370e9fec177d24ac9e958223d0be2ae8b4ddf6c26ffe8b30fbdc7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/888517b719ed1c22ef6b2e0d5432586a23f59a892c25ce5a12f909bc657287d5.webp","width":138,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:320054:87463:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c94193","characterName":"橘 伊織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"87464","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"320054"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23205"],"vndbCharacterId":"c94193"},"originalCharacterName":"橘 伊織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cool older sister-type who works in a bar. She's a bit meddlesome but has a friendly personality and a playful side. She has never been in a relationship before but isn't shy about it. For some reason, she looks pretty dependable, often being asked for life advice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the heroine of the official short story Wedding Anniversary of Blue Moon."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94193"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"バーで働くかっこいいお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少しお節介なところはあるものの、気さくな性格で茶目っ気な一面も持っている姐御肌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなお姉さん、実は恋愛経験はないのだが、それを恥ずかしがることもなく堂々としているため、何故かすごく頼れそうに見えてよく人生相談とかをされている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23205","sourceWorkId":"30259","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"バーで働くかっこいいお姉さん。少しお節介なところはあるものの、気さくな性格で茶目っ気な一面も持っている姐御肌。そんなお姉さん、実は恋愛経験はないのだが、それを恥ずかしがることもなく堂々としているため、何故かすごく頼れそうに見えてよく人生相談とかをされている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"87464"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df6b9b0d13e54db6c39510cb4acec653db389a2c8d064b25adbd62cf5572daa8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e29c6ef3d0b8c600ee50500ae2bb5403a646257d7b879df45f4e9d291c33dc5c.webp","width":138,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深田紗記子","creatorId":"vndb:s1658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1658","name":"葵時緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:320054:87464:17079:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c94301","characterName":"水無瀬 悠真","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"88005","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"320054"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23206"],"vndbCharacterId":"c94301"},"originalCharacterName":"水無瀬 悠真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"101"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist is a pleasant young man who is finally getting used to life as a member of society, but he is so desperate to get used to his new life as a member of society that he forgets to enjoy himself. In addition, he wasn't that much of an outdoorsman to begin with, so he just lazes around the house on his days off, and finally has so much time on his hands that he wonders what he's doing; but in the end, he's too heavy-handed to take any action."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, just as he starts to seriously want to change his current desiccated life, his junior, Natsuho, slaps his butt while saying \"go get yourself a girlfriend!\", and then he becomes a little more proactive."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94301"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ようやく社会人としての生活に慣れてきたノリの良い好青年な本作主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ社会人という新しい生活に慣れることに必死になりすぎてしまい、遊ぶことを忘れてしまった悲しき人。さらに元々そこまでアウトドア派でもなかったため、休日は家でダラダラしているだけで、ついにはあまりにも暇過ぎて「俺なにしてんだろう」とか思うのだが、結局何の行動も起こさずだらだらしてしまう腰が重い人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、今の枯れた生活を変えたいとも本気で思っており、そんな矢先に後輩の夏歩に彼女でも作れとケツを叩かれて、少し積極性を持つようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23206","sourceWorkId":"30259","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ようやく社会人としての生活に慣れてきたノリの良い好青年な本作主人公。 ただ社会人という新しい生活に慣れることに必死になりすぎてしまい、遊ぶことを忘れてしまった悲しき人。 さらに元々そこまでアウトドア派でもなかったため、休日は家でダラダラしているだけで、ついにはあまりにも暇過ぎて「俺なにしてんだろう」とか思うのだが、結局何の行動も起こさずだらだらしてしまう腰が重い人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、今の枯れた生活を変えたいとも本気で思っており、そんな矢先に後輩の夏歩に彼女でも作れとケツを叩かれて、少し積極性を持つようになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"88005"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c96293","characterName":"まい","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c96293"},"originalCharacterName":"まい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-ca